// SecurityQueryService is a read-only, Connect-compatible (gRPC / gRPC-Web /
// HTTP-JSON) projection of the pull-through proxy's supply-chain security data
// model. It exposes the same facts already served by the Task 67 GraphQL
// federated query API and the Task 79 MCP server — coordinate dossier lookup,
// findings/corpus queries, risk verdicts, provenance-graph edges, and the
// compliance scorecard — reusing the identical read-access layer rather than
// duplicating any query logic.
